nathan\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E分享重點：\u003Cbr\u003E✅揭示社企成功核心： 如何讓公益與盈利共生？\u003Cbr\u003E✅跨越地域的智慧： 香港與內地雙軌實踐中的挑戰與突破\u003Cbr\u003E✅ 個人與企業都能參與的社區祝福行動藍圖： 你的角色不只是聽眾！\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E&gt; 若社會企業註定在理想與現實間掙扎，為何寰宇希望能在香港與內地扎根20年，並持續擴大影響力？Jonathan將整合理性的商業模式與感性的人文故事，剖析社企可持續發展的關鍵。\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E日期：2026年1月24日（六）\u003Cbr\u003E時間：晚上7:30-9:00\u003Cbr\u003E地點：旺角家樂坊15樓安利體驗館會議室D\u003Cbr\u003E費用：$40\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E適合對象：\u003Cbr\u003E▪️ 尋找公益與商業平衡點的創業者\u003Cbr\u003E▪️ 關心社區創新的企業管理者\u003Cbr\u003E▪️ 非牟利組織工作者及義工\u003Cbr\u003E▪️ 任何想讓社會影響力更可持續的人\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","2026-01-24","寰宇希望香港執行總監 廖立恆Jonathan","social-enterprise-260124","2025-12-23T03:43:55.011Z",{"data":136},[137],{"id":138,"attributes":139},2,{"name":140,"slug":141,"description":7,"createdAt":142,"updatedAt":143},"名人面對面","be-our-guest","2023-02-12T02:38:55.942Z","2023-03-08T13:16:12.875Z",{"data":145},{"id":146,"attributes":147},85,{"name":148,"alternativeText":7,"caption":7,"width":149,"height":150,"formats":151,"hash":174,"ext":153,"mime":156,"size":175,"url":176,"previewUrl":7,"provider":64,"provider_metadata":7,"createdAt":177,"updatedAt":177},"1c.png",2400,1800,{"large":152,"small":159,"medium":164,"thumbnail":169},{"ext":153,"url":154,"hash":155,"mime":156,"name":157,"path":7,"size":158,"width":39,"height":40},".png","https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Flarge_1c_04d0ec2ae7.png","large_1c_04d0ec2ae7","image\u002Fpng","large_1c.png",446.47,{"ext":153,"url":160,"hash":161,"mime":156,"name":162,"path":7,"size":163,"width":46,"height":47},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fsmall_1c_04d0ec2ae7.png","small_1c_04d0ec2ae7","small_1c.png",163.16,{"ext":153,"url":165,"hash":166,"mime":156,"name":167,"path":7,"size":168,"width":40,"height":53},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fmedium_1c_04d0ec2ae7.png","medium_1c_04d0ec2ae7","medium_1c.png",294.16,{"ext":153,"url":170,"hash":171,"mime":156,"name":1